flowchart TD
    FAIL["Failure"] --> IDEM{idempotent/key?}
    IDEM -->|no| ERR["return error"]
    IDEM -->|yes| RETRY{retryable?}
    RETRY -->|no| ERR
    RETRY -->|yes| ATT{attempts left?}
    ATT -->|no| ERR
    ATT -->|yes| WAIT["wait backoff+jitter / Retry-After"]
    WAIT --> RT["retry"]
    RT --> SUC{success?}
    SUC -->|yes| OK["Success + breaker reset"]
    SUC -->|no| FAIL
